      "evidenceQualifications": [
        "The two survey-tagged edits deliberately name the two residential footprints and existing hamlet point. Survey provenance is mapper-declared, not independently certified fieldwork.",
        "All51 footprint vertices were refined in2024 despite unchanged way-node-reference lists. The actual OSC coordinate chain exactly reproduces current source shapes. The2026 edit only standardizes names.",
        "The hamlet point lies outside both residential footprints. This is a display association of the three explicitly reviewed source objects, not a geometric containment claim or village perimeter.",
        "Different named ruins in the same source changesets are excluded. Historical Google landmark results are not identity evidence.",
        "The existing official Eddouiret context proofs remain byte-identical. The group mutation is deferred until after their exact original before-record assertions have passed."
      ]
